MSD_musicnn_embedding.onnx

The MusicNN embedding model, exported to ONNX by LMS
(https://github.com/epoupon/lms, v3.81.0,
src/libs/audio/models/MSD_musicnn_embedding.onnx). The LMS repository is
GPL-3.0; the file carries no licence note of its own.

The weights are those of oriyonay/musicnn-pytorch on Hugging Face
(revision 394be17b3a5c2c2e1bb8a6593cfc3c5557eb8a82, weights/MSD_musicnn.pt),
Apache-2.0, a PyTorch port of Jordi Pons's musicnn
(https://github.com/jordipons/musicnn), ISC licence, trained on the Million
Song Dataset.

